[{"id":"faala-26-226-4","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"čine","en":"they do"},{"bs":"i čini","en":"and he/it does"},{"bs":"učinio si","en":"you did"},{"bs":"i činite!","en":"and do!"}],"ref":"26:226","answerWord":"يَفْعَلُونَ","answerSound":"audio/9c0608927f12e7c8bad0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And how they say that which they do not?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["وَأَنَّهُمْ","يَقُولُونَ","مَا","لَا","يَفْعَلُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-21-23-3","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"čini","en":"he/it does"},{"bs":"učini!","en":"do!"},{"bs":"učinio si","en":"you did"},{"bs":"i čine","en":"and they do"}],"ref":"21:23","answerWord":"يَفْعَلُ","answerSound":"audio/597159b636f675f6b410.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He will not be questioned as to that which He doeth, but they will be questioned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["لَا","يُسْـَٔلُ","عَمَّا","يَفْعَلُ","وَهُمْ","يُسْـَٔلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-82-12-2","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"činite","en":"you (all) do"},{"bs":"učinili ste","en":"you (all) did"},{"bs":"i čini","en":"and he/it does"},{"bs":"čini ga","en":"he/it does it"}],"ref":"82:12","answerWord":"تَفْعَلُونَ","answerSound":"audio/b5fe2ab0524ef9944382.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who know (all) that ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["يَعْلَمُونَ","مَا","تَفْعَلُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-54-52-2","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"učinili su ga","en":"they did it"},{"bs":"pa učinite!","en":"so (you all) do!"},{"bs":"učini!","en":"do!"},{"bs":"i učinio si","en":"and you did"}],"ref":"54:52","answerWord":"فَعَلُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/22df8cdf9da3f78fb743.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And every thing they did is in the scriptures,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["وَكُلُّ","شَىْءٍ","فَعَلُوهُ","فِى","ٱلزُّبُرِ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-3-135-2","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"učinili su","en":"they did"},{"bs":"činite ga","en":"you (all) do it"},{"bs":"učinili ste","en":"you (all) did"},{"bs":"čine","en":"they do"}],"ref":"3:135","answerWord":"فَعَلُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/c361becb2677aad996b9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who, when they do an evil thing or wrong themselves, remember Allah and implore forgiveness for their sins - Who forgiveth sins save Allah only? - and will not knowingly repeat (the wrong) they did.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","إِذَا","فَعَلُوا۟","فَٰحِشَةً","أَوْ","ظَلَمُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","ذَكَرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","فَٱسْتَغْفَرُوا۟","لِذُنُوبِهِمْ","وَمَن","يَغْفِرُ","ٱلذُّنُوبَ","إِلَّا","ٱللَّهُ","وَلَمْ","يُصِرُّوا۟","عَلَىٰ","مَا","فَعَلُوا۟","وَهُمْ","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[2,20],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-10-106-11","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"učinio si","en":"you did"},{"bs":"učinio je","en":"he/it did"},{"bs":"biva učinjeno","en":"it is done"},{"bs":"činite","en":"you (all) do"}],"ref":"10:106","answerWord":"فَعَلْتَ","answerSound":"audio/956a0e8d3e84cf3e2faf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And cry not, beside Allah, unto that which cannot profit thee nor hurt thee, for if thou didst so then wert thou of the wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَدْعُ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","مَا","لَا","يَنفَعُكَ","وَلَا","يَضُرُّكَ","فَإِن","فَعَلْتَ","فَإِنَّكَ","إِذًا","مِّنَ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-2-234-17","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"učinile su","en":"they did"},{"bs":"činite","en":"you (all) do"},{"bs":"učinio si","en":"you did"},{"bs":"biva učinjeno","en":"it is done"}],"ref":"2:234","answerWord":"فَعَلْنَ","answerSound":"audio/7e72ca3a23cb649014d5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Such of you as die and leave behind them wives, they (the wives) shall wait, keeping themselves apart, four months and ten days. And when they reach the term (prescribed for them) then there is no sin for you in aught that they may do with themselves in decency. Allah is informed of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يُتَوَفَّوْنَ","مِنكُمْ","وَيَذَرُونَ","أَزْوَٰجًا","يَتَرَبَّصْنَ","بِأَنفُسِهِنَّ","أَرْبَعَةَ","أَشْهُرٍ","وَعَشْرًا","فَإِذَا","بَلَغْنَ","أَجَلَهُنَّ","فَلَا","جُنَاحَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","فِيمَا","فَعَلْنَ","فِىٓ","أَنفُسِهِنَّ","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","وَٱللَّهُ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ","خَبِيرٌ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-3-115-1","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"čine","en":"they do"},{"bs":"čini ga","en":"he/it does it"},{"bs":"učinili su","en":"they did"},{"bs":"učinili su ga","en":"they did it"}],"ref":"3:115","answerWord":"يَفْعَلُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/dbd18cfc1b0294a63245.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whatever good they do, they will not be denied the meed thereof. Allah is Aware of those who ward off (evil).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["وَمَا","يَفْعَلُوا۟","مِنْ","خَيْرٍ","فَلَن","يُكْفَرُوهُ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِٱلْمُتَّقِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-16-50-4","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"i čine","en":"and they do"},{"bs":"čini","en":"he/it does"},{"bs":"učinio ga je","en":"he/it did it"},{"bs":"i činite!","en":"and do!"}],"ref":"16:50","answerWord":"وَيَفْعَلُونَ","answerSound":"audio/262f98d451b9771b2072.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They fear their Lord above them, and do what they are bidden.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["يَخَافُونَ","رَبَّهُم","مِّن","فَوْقِهِمْ","وَيَفْعَلُونَ","مَا","يُؤْمَرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-77-18-1","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"postupamo","en":"We do (deal)"},{"bs":"činite","en":"you (all) do"},{"bs":"biva učinjeno","en":"it is done"},{"bs":"učinio je","en":"he/it did"}],"ref":"77:18","answerWord":"نَفْعَلُ","answerSound":"audio/f19bd78a35d4efcf5afc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus deal We ever with the guilty.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["كَذَٰلِكَ","نَفْعَلُ","بِٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-2-68-20","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"pa učinite!","en":"so (you all) do!"},{"bs":"čini","en":"he/it does"},{"bs":"učinio sam ga","en":"I did it"},{"bs":"učinili su ga","en":"they did it"}],"ref":"2:68","answerWord":"فَٱفْعَلُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/2a5576010dcc6f32f076.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: Pray for us unto thy Lord that He make clear to us what (cow) she is. (Moses) answered: Lo! He saith, Verily she is a cow neither with calf nor immature; (she is) between the two conditions; so do that which ye are commanded.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","ٱدْعُ","لَنَا","رَبَّكَ","يُبَيِّن","لَّنَا","مَا","هِىَ","قَالَ","إِنَّهُۥ","يَقُولُ","إِنَّهَا","بَقَرَةٌ","لَّا","فَارِضٌ","وَلَا","بِكْرٌ","عَوَانٌۢ","بَيْنَ","ذَٰلِكَ","فَٱفْعَلُوا۟","مَا","تُؤْمَرُونَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-8-73-6","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"činite ga","en":"you (all) do it"},{"bs":"učinio je","en":"he/it did"},{"bs":"činite","en":"you (all) do"},{"bs":"učinio si","en":"you did"}],"ref":"8:73","answerWord":"تَفْعَلُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/f14299556edf79abeada.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who disbelieve are protectors one of another - If ye do not so, there will be confusion in the land, and great corruption.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","بَعْضُهُمْ","أَوْلِيَآءُ","بَعْضٍ","إِلَّا","تَفْعَلُوهُ","تَكُن","فِتْنَةٌ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَفَسَادٌ","كَبِيرٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-11-87-11","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"činimo","en":"we do"},{"bs":"biva učinjeno","en":"it is done"},{"bs":"čine","en":"they do"},{"bs":"čini","en":"he/it does"}],"ref":"11:87","answerWord":"نَّفْعَلَ","answerSound":"audio/77f3ed88485b8039d6e9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: O Shu'eyb! Doth thy way of prayer command thee that we should forsake that which our fathers (used to) worship, or that we (should leave off) doing what we will with our own property. Lo! thou art the mild, the guide to right behaviour.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","يَٰشُعَيْبُ","أَصَلَوٰتُكَ","تَأْمُرُكَ","أَن","نَّتْرُكَ","مَا","يَعْبُدُ","ءَابَآؤُنَآ","أَوْ","أَن","نَّفْعَلَ","فِىٓ","أَمْوَٰلِنَا","مَا","نَشَٰٓؤُا۟","إِنَّكَ","لَأَنتَ","ٱلْحَلِيمُ","ٱلرَّشِيدُ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-12-89-4","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"učinili ste","en":"you (all) did"},{"bs":"učinili smo","en":"we did"},{"bs":"pa učinite!","en":"so (you all) do!"},{"bs":"učinio ga je","en":"he/it did it"}],"ref":"12:89","answerWord":"فَعَلْتُم","answerSound":"audio/2163dd2b25dfdff4b1ee.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Know ye what ye did unto Joseph and his brother in your ignorance?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["قَالَ","هَلْ","عَلِمْتُم","مَّا","فَعَلْتُم","بِيُوسُفَ","وَأَخِيهِ","إِذْ","أَنتُمْ","جَٰهِلُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-14-27-14","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"i čini","en":"and he/it does"},{"bs":"učinile su","en":"they did"},{"bs":"učinio je","en":"he/it did"},{"bs":"učinio sam ga","en":"I did it"}],"ref":"14:27","answerWord":"وَيَفْعَلُ","answerSound":"audio/6f05a64db2080249da3b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah confirmeth those who believe by a firm saying in the life of the world and in the Hereafter, and Allah sendeth wrong-doers astray. And Allah doeth what He will.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["يُثَبِّتُ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","بِٱلْقَوْلِ","ٱلثَّابِتِ","فِى","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَفِى","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","وَيُضِلُّ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ","وَيَفْعَلُ","ٱللَّهُ","مَا","يَشَآءُ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-14-45-9","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"učinili smo","en":"we did"},{"bs":"čini","en":"he/it does"},{"bs":"činite ga","en":"you (all) do it"},{"bs":"činimo","en":"we do"}],"ref":"14:45","answerWord":"فَعَلْنَا","answerSound":"audio/a0adb67d0b2218cf4155.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (have ye not) dwelt in the dwellings of those who wronged themselves (of old) and (hath it not) become plain to you how We dealt with them and made examples for you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["وَسَكَنتُمْ","فِى","مَسَٰكِنِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","وَتَبَيَّنَ","لَكُمْ","كَيْفَ","فَعَلْنَا","بِهِمْ","وَضَرَبْنَا","لَكُمُ","ٱلْأَمْثَالَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-21-63-2","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"učinio ga je","en":"he/it did it"},{"bs":"čine","en":"they do"},{"bs":"učinio sam ga","en":"I did it"},{"bs":"i činite!","en":"and do!"}],"ref":"21:63","answerWord":"فَعَلَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/cf7667947f633533ef9c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: But this, their chief hath done it. So question them, if they can speak.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["قَالَ","بَلْ","فَعَلَهُۥ","كَبِيرُهُمْ","هَٰذَا","فَسْـَٔلُوهُمْ","إِن","كَانُوا۟","يَنطِقُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-22-77-7","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"i činite!","en":"and do!"},{"bs":"biva učinjeno","en":"it is done"},{"bs":"čini","en":"he/it does"},{"bs":"učinio si","en":"you did"}],"ref":"22:77","answerWord":"وَٱفْعَلُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/2935c5546aae4d9233ba.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Bow down and prostrate yourselves, and worship your Lord, and do good, that haply ye may prosper.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","ٱرْكَعُوا۟","وَٱسْجُدُوا۟","وَٱعْبُدُوا۟","رَبَّكُمْ","وَٱفْعَلُوا۟","ٱلْخَيْرَ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تُفْلِحُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-26-19-0","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"i učinio si","en":"and you did"},{"bs":"učinjeno je","en":"it was done"},{"bs":"činite","en":"you (all) do"},{"bs":"biva učinjeno","en":"it is done"}],"ref":"26:19","answerWord":"وَفَعَلْتَ","answerSound":"audio/5c6e61ec3b4a6540dc87.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And thou didst that thy deed which thou didst, and thou wast one of the ingrates.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["وَفَعَلْتَ","فَعْلَتَكَ","ٱلَّتِى","فَعَلْتَ","وَأَنتَ","مِنَ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"faala-26-20-1","words":["verb:faala"],"options":[{"bs":"učinio sam ga","en":"I did it"},{"bs":"učinjeno je","en":"it was done"},{"bs":"čine","en":"they do"},{"bs":"učinio ga je","en":"he/it did it"}],"ref":"26:20","answerWord":"فَعَلْتُهَآ","answerSound":"audio/8d062e2f8b1934aa1b1d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: I did it then, when I was of those who are astray.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti, uraditi","en":"to do"},"passage":["قَالَ","فَعَلْتُهَآ","إِذًا","وَأَنَا۠","مِنَ","ٱلضَّآلِّينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"فَعَلَ"}},{"id":"ajaba-5-100-6","words":["verb:ajaba"],"options":[{"bs":"dopao ti se","en":"he/it pleased you"},{"bs":"dopada ti se","en":"he/it pleases you"},{"bs":"dopao vam se","en":"he/it pleased you (all)"},{"bs":"dopala vam se","en":"she/it pleased you (all)"}],"ref":"5:100","answerWord":"أَعْجَبَكَ","answerSound":"audio/c724e565c80c50f3a1ed.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: The evil and the good are not alike even though the plenty of the evil attract thee. So be mindful of your duty to Allah, O men of understanding, that ye may succeed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dopasti se, oduševiti","en":"to please, to impress"},"passage":["قُل","لَّا","يَسْتَوِى","ٱلْخَبِيثُ","وَٱلطَّيِّبُ","وَلَوْ","أَعْجَبَكَ","كَثْرَةُ","ٱلْخَبِيثِ","فَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","يَٰٓأُو۟لِى","ٱلْأَلْبَٰبِ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تُفْلِحُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَعْجَبَ"}},{"id":"ajaba-2-204-3","words":["verb:ajaba"],"options":[{"bs":"dopada ti se","en":"he/it pleases you"},{"bs":"dopada se","en":"he/it pleases"},{"bs":"dopala vam se","en":"she/it pleased you (all)"},{"bs":"dopao ti se","en":"he/it pleased you"}],"ref":"2:204","answerWord":"يُعْجِبُكَ","answerSound":"audio/5df1bfe65db35d7831e0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And of mankind there is he whoso conversation on the life of this world pleaseth thee (Muhammad), and he calleth Allah to witness as to that which is in his heart; yet he is the most rigid of opponents.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dopasti se, oduševiti","en":"to please, to impress"},"passage":["وَمِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","مَن","يُعْجِبُكَ","قَوْلُهُۥ","فِى","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَيُشْهِدُ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","فِى","قَلْبِهِۦ","وَهُوَ","أَلَدُّ","ٱلْخِصَامِ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَعْجَبَ"}},{"id":"amadda-26-133-0","words":["verb:amadda"],"options":[{"bs":"opskrbio vas je","en":"He provided you"},{"bs":"pomaže vam","en":"he/it reinforces you (all)"},{"bs":"opskrbljujemo","en":"we supply"},{"bs":"i opskrbili smo ih","en":"and we supplied them"}],"ref":"26:133","answerWord":"أَمَدَّكُم","answerSound":"audio/db03b3c8a3d350381be2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Hath aided you with cattle and sons.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opskrbiti, pomoći","en":"to supply, to provide"},"passage":["أَمَدَّكُم","بِأَنْعَٰمٍ","وَبَنِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَمَدَّ"}},{"id":"amadda-3-124-6","words":["verb:amadda"],"options":[{"bs":"pomaže vam","en":"he/it reinforces you (all)"},{"bs":"zar me opskrbljujete?","en":"do you (all) supply me?"},{"bs":"i opskrbili smo vas","en":"and we supplied you (all)"},{"bs":"opskrbio vas je","en":"He provided you"}],"ref":"3:124","answerWord":"يُمِدَّكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/5f7bf05283f106783b8e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When thou didst say unto the believers: Is it not sufficient for you that your Lord should support you with three thousand angels sent down (to your help)?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opskrbiti, pomoći","en":"to supply, to provide"},"passage":["إِذْ","تَقُولُ","لِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","أَلَن","يَكْفِيَكُمْ","أَن","يُمِدَّكُمْ","رَبُّكُم","بِثَلَٰثَةِ","ءَالَٰفٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","مُنزَلِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَمَدَّ"}},{"id":"amadda-3-125-8","words":["verb:amadda"],"options":[{"bs":"pomaže vam","en":"he/it reinforces you (all)"},{"bs":"zar me opskrbljujete?","en":"do you (all) supply me?"},{"bs":"pružamo im","en":"We extend (to them)"},{"bs":"i opskrbili smo ih","en":"and we supplied them"}],"ref":"3:125","answerWord":"يُمْدِدْكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/a4a5c68be43a49b85332.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but if ye persevere, and keep from evil, and (the enemy) attack you suddenly, your Lord will help you with five thousand angels sweeping on.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opskrbiti, pomoći","en":"to supply, to provide"},"passage":["بَلَىٰٓ","إِن","تَصْبِرُوا۟","وَتَتَّقُوا۟","وَيَأْتُوكُم","مِّن","فَوْرِهِمْ","هَٰذَا","يُمْدِدْكُمْ","رَبُّكُم","بِخَمْسَةِ","ءَالَٰفٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","مُسَوِّمِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَمَدَّ"}},{"id":"amadda-17-6-5","words":["verb:amadda"],"options":[{"bs":"i opskrbili smo vas","en":"and we supplied you (all)"},{"bs":"i opskrbljuje vas","en":"and he/it supplies you (all)"},{"bs":"zar me opskrbljujete?","en":"do you (all) supply me?"},{"bs":"pružamo im","en":"We extend (to them)"}],"ref":"17:6","answerWord":"وَأَمْدَدْنَٰكُم","answerSound":"audio/b779762f2833815354fd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then we gave you once again your turn against them, and We aided you with wealth and children and made you more in soldiery.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opskrbiti, pomoći","en":"to supply, to provide"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","رَدَدْنَا","لَكُمُ","ٱلْكَرَّةَ","عَلَيْهِمْ","وَأَمْدَدْنَٰكُم","بِأَمْوَٰلٍ","وَبَنِينَ","وَجَعَلْنَٰكُمْ","أَكْثَرَ","نَفِيرًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَمَدَّ"}},{"id":"amadda-17-20-1","words":["verb:amadda"],"options":[{"bs":"opskrbljujemo","en":"we supply"},{"bs":"pomaže vam","en":"he/it reinforces you (all)"},{"bs":"opskrbio vas je","en":"He provided you"},{"bs":"zar me opskrbljujete?","en":"do you (all) supply me?"}],"ref":"17:20","answerWord":"نُّمِدُّ","answerSound":"audio/429cd0e9792fd37acc97.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Each do We supply, both these and those, from the bounty of thy Lord. And the bounty of thy Lord can never be walled up.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opskrbiti, pomoći","en":"to supply, to provide"},"passage":["كُلًّا","نُّمِدُّ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","وَهَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","مِنْ","عَطَآءِ","رَبِّكَ","وَمَا","كَانَ","عَطَآءُ","رَبِّكَ","مَحْظُورًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَمَدَّ"}},{"id":"amadda-23-55-2","words":["verb:amadda"],"options":[{"bs":"pružamo im","en":"We extend (to them)"},{"bs":"pomaže vam","en":"he/it reinforces you (all)"},{"bs":"i opskrbili smo vas","en":"and we supplied you (all)"},{"bs":"opskrbljujemo","en":"we supply"}],"ref":"23:55","answerWord":"نُمِدُّهُم","answerSound":"audio/788305e51163785ec815.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Think they that in the wealth and sons wherewith We provide them","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opskrbiti, pomoći","en":"to supply, to provide"},"passage":["أَيَحْسَبُونَ","أَنَّمَا","نُمِدُّهُم","بِهِۦ","مِن","مَّالٍ","وَبَنِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَمَدَّ"}},{"id":"amadda-27-36-4","words":["verb:amadda"],"options":[{"bs":"zar me opskrbljujete?","en":"do you (all) supply me?"},{"bs":"opskrbio vas je","en":"He provided you"},{"bs":"pružamo im","en":"We extend (to them)"},{"bs":"i opskrbljuje vas","en":"and he/it supplies you (all)"}],"ref":"27:36","answerWord":"أَتُمِدُّونَنِ","answerSound":"audio/e4b290da455cefcb05ae.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So when (the envoy) came unto Solomon, (the King) said: What! Would ye help me with wealth? But that which Allah hath given me is better than that which He hath given you. Nay it is ye (and not I) who exult in your gift.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opskrbiti, pomoći","en":"to supply, to provide"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","جَآءَ","سُلَيْمَٰنَ","قَالَ","أَتُمِدُّونَنِ","بِمَالٍ","فَمَآ","ءَاتَىٰنِۦَ","ٱللَّهُ","خَيْرٌ","مِّمَّآ","ءَاتَىٰكُم","بَلْ","أَنتُم","بِهَدِيَّتِكُمْ","تَفْرَحُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَمَدَّ"}},{"id":"amadda-52-22-0","words":["verb:amadda"],"options":[{"bs":"i opskrbili smo ih","en":"and we supplied them"},{"bs":"i opskrbljuje vas","en":"and he/it supplies you (all)"},{"bs":"zar me opskrbljujete?","en":"do you (all) supply me?"},{"bs":"opskrbljujemo","en":"we supply"}],"ref":"52:22","answerWord":"وَأَمْدَدْنَٰهُم","answerSound":"audio/2bab54e29a2660553752.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We provide them with fruit and meat such as they desire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opskrbiti, pomoći","en":"to supply, to provide"},"passage":["وَأَمْدَدْنَٰهُم","بِفَٰكِهَةٍ","وَلَحْمٍ","مِّمَّا","يَشْتَهُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَمَدَّ"}},{"id":"amadda-71-12-0","words":["verb:amadda"],"options":[{"bs":"i opskrbljuje vas","en":"and he/it supplies you (all)"},{"bs":"opskrbio vas je","en":"He provided you"},{"bs":"i opskrbili smo vas","en":"and we supplied you (all)"},{"bs":"i opskrbili smo ih","en":"and we supplied them"}],"ref":"71:12","answerWord":"وَيُمْدِدْكُم","answerSound":"audio/d328eb4cb660c9426eb1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And will help you with wealth and sons, and will assign unto you Gardens and will assign unto you rivers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opskrbiti, pomoći","en":"to supply, to provide"},"passage":["وَيُمْدِدْكُم","بِأَمْوَٰلٍ","وَبَنِينَ","وَيَجْعَل","لَّكُمْ","جَنَّٰتٍ","وَيَجْعَل","لَّكُمْ","أَنْهَٰرًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَمَدَّ"}},{"id":"daafa-57-11-7","words":["verb:daafa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa da mu ga umnoži","en":"so He multiplies it"},{"bs":"biva udvostručen","en":"he/it is doubled"},{"bs":"udvostručuje","en":"he/it doubles"},{"bs":"udvostručuje ga","en":"he/it doubles it"}],"ref":"57:11","answerWord":"فَيُضَٰعِفَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/7b431622914dbc423678.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who is he that will lend unto Allah a goodly loan, that He may double it for him and his may be a rich reward?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"udvostručiti, umnožiti","en":"to double, to multiply"},"passage":["مَّن","ذَا","ٱلَّذِى","يُقْرِضُ","ٱللَّهَ","قَرْضًا","حَسَنًا","فَيُضَٰعِفَهُۥ","لَهُۥ","وَلَهُۥٓ","أَجْرٌ","كَرِيمٌ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"ضَاعَفَ"}},{"id":"daafa-4-40-9","words":["verb:daafa"],"options":[{"bs":"udvostručuje ga","en":"he/it doubles it"},{"bs":"pa da mu ga umnoži","en":"so He multiplies it"},{"bs":"biva udvostručen","en":"he/it is doubled"},{"bs":"udvostručuje","en":"he/it doubles"}],"ref":"4:40","answerWord":"يُضَٰعِفْهَا","answerSound":"audio/5a8beacd05d2ecc879ae.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Allah wrongeth not even of the weight of an ant; and if there is a good deed, He will double it and will give (the doer) from His presence an immense reward.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"udvostručiti, umnožiti","en":"to double, to multiply"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يَظْلِمُ","مِثْقَالَ","ذَرَّةٍ","وَإِن","تَكُ","حَسَنَةً","يُضَٰعِفْهَا","وَيُؤْتِ","مِن","لَّدُنْهُ","أَجْرًا","عَظِيمًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"ضَاعَفَ"}}]